{"about_the_game":"The intense physical play, fast-paced action, and many thrilling and fun arcade game modes will leave you breathless as you take over the court in a larger than life basketball arena surrounded by exhilarating sights and sounds that only the pros get to experience. With all sorts of thrilling and fun arcade game modes that you can\u2019t do anywhere else but in Hoops Madness\u23e4you\u2019ll never want to play in reality again!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHoops Madness is a unique VR basketball experience that embodies competitive, real-world, physically active sports for individual and player-vs-player (PvP) competition of skill and fitness. Receive points for consistency, trick shots, and game mode bonuses. Features include:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25cf\tPhysics-based Realistic &amp; Satisfying Ball Handling<br />\r\n\u25cf\tOnline Multiplayer <br />\r\n\u25cf\tMatch-Based Play<br />\r\n\u25cf\tPlethora of Game Modes<br />\r\n\u25cf\tSkill-Based<br />\r\n\u25cf\tCustom Match Set-up<br />\r\n\u25cf\tImmersive Dynamic Environments<br />\r\n\u25cf\tThemed In-Game 3D Tutorials<br />\r\n\u25cf\tAchievements<br />\r\n\u25cf\tLeaderboards and Tournaments","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7d4c561e35e6f647f5104377dc98c386da5119e2.jpg","localized_name":"Beginner's Luck","name":"Beginner's Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1323220/7d4c561e35e6f647f5104377dc98c386da5119e2.jpg"},{"icon":"fd13fbaacb6999510740afeb9293c88cf5f2ccdf.jpg","localized_name":"AAAIRBAAALLLLLL","name":"AAAIRBAAALLLLLL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1323220/fd13fbaacb6999510740afeb9293c88cf5f2ccdf.jpg"},{"icon":"5c3b9aea99b810db6cd2e45e8ac1a8fb84ec0763.jpg","localized_name":"Double Figures","name":"Double Figures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1323220/5c3b9aea99b810db6cd2e45e8ac1a8fb84ec0763.jpg"},{"icon":"52511c02e2e3e92c310b743707d72962060b1f9f.jpg"